          <groundspeak:finder id="7458582">mkPerry</groundspeak:finder>
          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP410 McKenney Ave

Out grabbing a few more BCPs on the last day for logging them. 

The open area here made it much windier than our previous stops. The find was quick with a stake place by a nice surveyor indicating the ASCM number. Doesn't match what's on the cap though. &lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Thanks outforthehunt for all the BCPs and the fun I've had over the last couple weeks getting most of the ones in the Edmonton area. &lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
