          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP410 McKenney Ave&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;I remember finding a cache near here but missed knowing about the cap at the time.  It was nice as I knew where to park in the neighborhood.  Parked there instead of at the park parking lot for the extra walk.  The cap just took a few minutes for me to find.....just had to lift my head up basically.  lol  TFTBC and another nice one!&lt;/p&gt;

